=== PDI1 ===
+ /etc/systemd:
	+ /etc/module-loads.d (load modules at boot)
	
    + /etc/system.d -> targets (local-fs.target - remounting rootfilesystems in rw mode)
    
    	+ /etc/fstab -> t tells the system what partitions, devices, or remote filesystems to automatically mount, where, and how.
    	
	+ /etc/sysctl.d (IP forwarding)
	+ /etc/udev/rules.d 
	+ /etc/network/interfaces.d (create network interface)
	
    + /etc/system.d -> userlogin
